{"ID":"20240118144955-8u8okoj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144955-8u8okoj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144955-8u8okoj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144955-14wrtxj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170354-q38dx3e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170354-q38dx3e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:130,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:130\u0026#125;","title":"374补17李根白皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240204164642"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144955-14wrtxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144955-14wrtxj","updated":"20240122170341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】即李树之根。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170343-y1t8h58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170343-y1t8h58"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸性大寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170344-bib7rke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170344-bib7rke"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为解热药，治消渴，奔豚气逆。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170346-gb5tiwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170346-gb5tiwq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】李根白皮治消渴，止心烦，逆奔豚气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170347-wcu0fa9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170347-wcu0fa9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】将之炙黄煎汤，日再饮之，治女人卒赤白带下。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170349-hohcsxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170349-hohcsxf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治脚下气，主热毒烦躁，煮汁服止消渴 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170352-ibh42ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170352-ibh42ly"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般三钱至五钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170353-86ef9vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170353-86ef9vw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】津液不足者忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170353-p502vnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170353-p502vnb"}},{"ID":"20240122170354-ckjs422","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170354-ckjs422"}},{"ID":"20240122170354-q38dx3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170354-q38dx3e","updated":"20240204164642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第17，李根白皮，这李树的根，过去呢，东南角，东南角的李树根，因为它是东南方嘛，那是巽卦属于风位，那味咸性大寒，解热的药，治消渴，这个李根白皮呢，主治消渴，现在来说呢，一般来说你买不到，你要跑到那个种李树的农家，你到底下去挖几个根出来，自己做可以，那就是李树的根，一般来说主治消渴，口渴，渴饮百杯不能止渴，奔豚气逆，都可以使用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个奔豚气逆就是觉得身上心跳得很快，好像甚而身上热水在滚着，还有病人会跟你陈述说：奇怪好象有个人上面有个腾，热的茶壶，然后把水倒着从我头上灌下来，哇那热水一直灌下来，摸摸看又没有啊冰冰的，他就是感到很热，还在身上跑来跑去，这都属于奔豚气逆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}